<pending_commit branch="master" change_id="I23b639bd8942c4b54868e0e06417b5799a854089" commit="3a3cbc39e169eddc9b55cedaf3c0510dd6a487f7" commit_message="cryptohome: Use std::string instead of string  We use string a lot, and in some function, we use std::string while &quot;use std::string&quot; is already defined. To match chrome usage, remove 'using std:string' and use std:string throughout. Remove &lt;string&gt; when not used. Used a variation of grep -lrn &quot;string&quot; | grep -e &quot;\.cc$&quot; | \ xargs sed -e &quot;s,\([^:&lt;_/]\)string,\1std::string,g&quot; -i  BUG=none TEST=Unit tests.  Change-Id: I23b639bd8942c4b54868e0e06417b5799a854089 Signed-off-by: Gwendal Grignou &lt;gwendal@chromium.org&gt; Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/353349 Reviewed-by: Darren Krahn &lt;dkrahn@chromium.org&gt; " fail_count="1" gerrit_number="353349" owner_email="gwendal@chromium.org" pass_count="0" patch_number="3" project="chromiumos/platform2" project_url="https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/chromiumos/platform2" ref="refs/changes/49/353349/3" remote="cros" total_fail_count="1"/><pending_commit branch="master" change_id="Iad520b0a522ef229556a68c35ada6ca9cd0384c5" commit="cc64927d09b0ffac1635ee1661333712f24a970b" commit_message="cryptohome: Remove Mount::DoForEveryUnmountedCryptohome, unused.  Mount::DoForEveryUnmountedCryptohome is not used, only HomeDirs::DoForEveryUnmountedCryptohome is.  BUG=None TEST=Unit test.  Change-Id: Iad520b0a522ef229556a68c35ada6ca9cd0384c5 Signed-off-by: Gwendal Grignou &lt;gwendal@chromium.org&gt; Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/353470 Reviewed-by: Darren Krahn &lt;dkrahn@chromium.org&gt; " fail_count="1" gerrit_number="353470" owner_email="gwendal@chromium.org" pass_count="0" patch_number="3" project="chromiumos/platform2" project_url="https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/chromiumos/platform2" ref="refs/changes/70/353470/3" remote="cros" total_fail_count="1"/><pending_commit branch="master